<hr>
<h3>Part 4: Verify Before You Believe</h3>
<div class="question">12. (Multiple Choice) What is the very first step of the PlayIQ Verification Ritual?</div>
<ul>
<li><span class="checkbox">&#9744;</span> Can I cross-check it?</li>
<li><span class="checkbox">&#9744;</span> Does this make sense?</li>
<li><span class="checkbox">&#9744;</span> Is anything missing?</li>
<li><span class="checkbox">&#9744;</span> Can I explain it myself?</li>
</ul>
<div class="question">13. (Scenario) An AI tells you that "Fractions are always smaller than whole numbers." You think back to improper fractions like 5/4. What part of the Verification Ritual are you using?</div>
<div class="response-box">
  <p class="response-label">✍️ Student Response Area (Double-click to type)</p>
  <p class="response-placeholder">[ Type your conceptual answer or explanation here... ]</p>
</div>
<div class="response-box">
  <p class="response-label">✍️ Student Response Area (Double-click to type)</p>
  <p class="response-placeholder">[ Type your conceptual answer or explanation here... ]</p>
</div>
