<h3>Part 5: Integrity and Identity</h3>
<div class="question">15. (Classification) You ask AI to give you a hint, and then you finish solving the problem yourself. Is this Coach, Cheat, or Borderline?</div>
<div class="response-box">
  <p class="response-label">✍️ Student Response Area (Double-click to type)</p>
