</div>
<div class="response-box">
  <p class="response-label">✍️ Student Response Area (Double-click to type)</p>
  <p class="response-placeholder">[ Type your conceptual answer or explanation here... ]</p>
</div>
<div class="question">16. (Classification) You copy an AI answer directly into your homework because you are tired and don't want to think. Is this Coach, Cheat, or Borderline?</div>
<div class="response-box">
