<hr>
<h3>Part 6: Social Impact & Digital Power</h3>
<div class="question">19. (Multiple Choice) Before sharing a surprising fact online, you should use the Pause Before Share Rule. Which of the following is NOT one of those questions?</div>
<ul>
<li><span class="checkbox">&#9744;</span> Is it true?</li>
<li><span class="checkbox">&#9744;</span> Will this get a lot of likes?</li>
<li><span class="checkbox">&#9744;</span> Is it respectful?</li>
<li><span class="checkbox">&#9744;</span> Could this hurt someone if I'm wrong?</li>
</ul>
<div class="question">20. (Scenario) A friend sends you a crazy, AI-generated image of a politician doing something embarrassing and says, "Post this!" Apply the Pause Before Share rule to explain what your next move should be.</div>
